2026-07-27T07:44:41.8593560Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-27T07:44:41.8594199Z i /tmp/RtmpQ1wucV/duckdb
2026-07-27T07:44:41.8594619Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T07:44:41.8595142Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T07:44:41.8595923Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T07:44:41.8596609Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T07:44:41.8597867Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T07:44:41.8598794Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
2026-07-27T07:44:41.8838590Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:52:3' [success]
2026-07-27T07:44:41.8947016Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:53:3' [success]
2026-07-27T07:44:41.9399238Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:59:3' [success]
2026-07-27T07:44:41.9575611Z End test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
